### 1. Get Debit Note KPI Card Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/debit-notes/kpi/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2. List Debit Notes (Paginated with Filters & Search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/debit-notes/?status=open&search=Chicking
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3. Get Bill Details for Debit Note Construction (Prefill Endpoint)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/debit-notes/bill-details/?bill=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4. Create New Debit Note
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/debit-notes/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendor": 1,
  "bill": 1,
  "issue_date": "2026-04-28",
  "reason": "damaged_goods",
  "notes": "Damaged goods returned to vendor",
  "items": [
    {
      "bill_item": 1,
      "product": 1,
      "item_name": "Product 1 description",
      "billed_qty": "400.00",
      "already_debited_qty": "0.00",
      "quantity": "80.00",
      "rate": "18.50",
      "vat_percentage": "15.00"
    }
  ]
}

###

### 5. Get Debit Note Detail by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/debit-notes/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 6. Update Debit Note (Full PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/debit-notes/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendor": 1,
  "bill": 1,
  "issue_date": "2026-04-29",
  "reason": "defective_items",
  "notes": "Revised debit note for defective items",
  "debit_amount": "5000.00",
  "applied_amount": "1000.00"
}

###

### 7. Partial Update Debit Note Applied Amount (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/debit-notes/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applied_amount": "5000.00"
}

###

### 8. Export Debit Notes CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/debit-notes/export/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 9. Delete Debit Note
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/debit-notes/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
